Modifications:
  - response script: ad-detection caches bounded to 64 entries, optional
    background-play patch (enableBackgroundPlay), provenance header; the
    onesie key cache is retained because the UMP flow requires it;
  - request script: log_event dispatch disabled, only initplayback is handled,
    provenance header;
  - module rewritten: https-only patterns, bounded body buffering, no
    log_event interception.

Third-party service:
  UMP ad stripping redirects the playback init request to
  https://init-stream.maasea.workers.dev/ (operated by the upstream author),
  passing the client key and the signed media URL. That service is not part of
  this repository; it is required for UMP ad removal and is a third-party
  dependency. The log_event header rewriting from upstream is disabled.

Caption translation naming follows the upstream credit to @VirgilClyne.

